@title Review notes: write a note on the page, see it in the panel and the status bar
@area Schematic
# Ctrl+K "add review note" with nothing selected: the form offers the page first; the note lands in the Open list and the status bar counts it.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text add review note
wait 6
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Review notes"
expect "About"
shot form
text Title block still says draft
wait 4
shot form-typed
click_text "Add as Me"
wait 8
expect "N1"
expect "Title block still says draft"
expect "1 open note"
shot panel-one-note
check_layout
